              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *rastyāt paḍlelaṁ jhāḍ hā moṭhā aḍthaḷā hotā.* — The tree lying on the road was a big obstacle.]"
