          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तोडगा — toḍgā — \"a way out; a solution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दोन्ही भावांनी भांडणावर एक चांगला तोडगा काढला. donhī bhāvānnī bhāṇḍṇāvar ek cāṅglā toḍgā kāḍhlā. The two brothers found a good way out of the quarrel."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तोडगा (toḍgā) काढणे, to find a way out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तोडगा (toḍgā) is usually traced to तोडणे, \"to break\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit trōṭayati, \"breaks\" (CDIAL 6079): a way of breaking a deadlock. The ending -गा is not explained there."
            }
          ]
        },
