              "text": "पेलणे (pelṇe) may be inherited: CDIAL lists a Marathi pelṇẽ, \"to push\", under Sanskrit prērayati, \"sets in motion\" (CDIAL 9002), but not the sense \"to bear a load\", so the link is not settled."
